<title>JAPAN: Toyota to buy back up to 100 bln yen of its shares.</title>
<headline>Toyota to buy back up to 100 bln yen of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Thursday it had decided to buy back up to 100 billion yen worth of its own shares.  </p>
<p>Toyota said in a statement that details of the planned share repurchase would be decided later at its board meeting.</p>
<p>The plan must also be approved at the company's annual shareholders' meeting to be held at the end of June, Toyota said.</p>
</text>
